									"patching_rect" : [ 568.0, 184.0, 495.0, 248.0 ],
									"text" : "Speakers 1 & 2 are the stereo mains and are paired with stereo subs 15 & 16, respectively. \n\nAdding speakers 3 thru 8 gives an 8 channel array\nAdding speakers 9 thru 14 gives down-firing, Dolby Atmos style overhead speakers.\n\nNot included are 4 rear speakers that were not yet installed as of this date. These will be a pair of X40s mounted to the soffit at the rear of the room and X20 back fills\n\nAlso not included are two (currently installed) X20s that are just back of speakers 11 & 12. These are delays that are matrixed from the main pair for the benefit of the last two rows.\n\nAlso not included are two Meyer Sound 900-LFC subwoofers that can be added at arbirary locations.\n\nN.B.: The locations of Speakers 17 & 18 are approximate\n\n\n"
								}

